    Messages raised below the UI layer.

    Repositories, network clients and validators have no Context, so they carry
    a resource id in LocalizedException instead of a finished sentence, and the
    screen that shows the failure resolves it. Keeping them here rather than in
    each feature module means one place to translate and no duplicate keys.
-->
